note the methods of OmegaHopPanel. 0 controlTextDidChange: 1 numberOfRowsInTableView:
note 2 tableView:objectValueForTableColumn:row: (e is the row) 3 go: (the field's action, Enter: c is the sender;
note it is remembered, and opened when g_n 7 allows) 4 control:textView:doCommandBySelector: (e is
note the command: the arrows move the selection, Escape puts the panel away; 1 says the key was handled)
note 5 the hot key's handler (a C function for Carbon: 0 says no error) 6 applicationShouldHandleReopen:
note hasVisibleWindows: (a click on the Dock icon, or the app opened again) 7 URLSession:dataTask:didReceiveData:
note (e is the data) 8 URLSession:task:didCompleteWithError: (d the task, e the problem or nothing)
note 9 pasteNow: (a moment after a copied thing was chosen) 10 clipTick: (twice a second, to see what was copied)
note 11 pinClip: 12 deleteClip: (the Clipboard menu, on the selected copied thing) 13 agentOut: agentErr:
note agentEnd: stopAgent: (what the agent's program tells, and the Agent menu; b is the selector, c what came)
